#lang rhombus/static

// =====================================================================
// facade -- the core of Art 4, in Rhombus.
//
// Art (art3, in Racket) is a framework for extensible "Art languages":
// a host of *art forms* -- objects, coordinates, rewriters, and
// embeddings -- composed by the @-form, with rewriting driven by
// context.  Tonart (music), Spielart (scripts) and Programmart (concert
// programs) are instantiations of it.
//
// facade re-imagines that core in Rhombus.  This module is the starting
// point; the primitives grow here.
//
// Roadmap (mirrors art/private/core.rkt):
//   - art forms:   object | coordinate | rewriter | embedding | @-form
//   - objects:     a head plus fields
//   - coordinates: locate / scope forms; compose by merging
//   - the @-form:  attach coordinates to forms, scope rewriters
//   - rewriting:   context-driven transformation (current vs lookup ctxt)
//   - embeddings:  sub-contexts hosting another Art language
// =====================================================================

export:
  facade_version

def facade_version :: String = "0.0.1"
